# Optional Cloudflare Workers AI Credentials for Live Unseen Prompt Synthesis
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Note: All 36 built-in presets (8 Master Mathematical Paradigms, 7 Hamid
# Naderi Yeganeh 2D Pixel-Field Paintings, 12 Scientific American & Hamid
# Originals, 9 3D/4D presets), H-DGES Homotopy Inverse Distillation, Custom
# Formula Lab, and pre-cached scenes run 100% offline without any API keys.
#
# To enable live semantic-to-equation synthesis for arbitrary brand-new unseen
# prompts and unstructured long scripts, copy this file to `backend/.env` and
# fill in your Cloudflare Workers AI credentials:

CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your_cloudflare_account_id_here
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your_cloudflare_api_token_here
